                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The patient’s HbA1c is markedly elevated, indicating poor long-term glycemic control and likely poorly managed or undiagnosed diabetes mellitus. This increases the risk for microvascular and macrovascular complications, especially at her advanced age. Clinical follow-up and optimization of diabetes management are strongly recommended.</td>
